
>> shop := (Słownik nowy
	umieść: ['magazine'] w: ['books'],
	umieść: ['computer'] w: ['electronics'],
	umieść: ['lipstick'] w: ['cosmetics']
).
Wyjście pisz: (shop ma: ['computer']), nowa-linia. 
Wyjście pisz: (shop ma: ['sausage']), nowa-linia. 
Wyjście pisz: (shop ma: ['computers']), nowa-linia. 
Wyjście pisz: (shop ma: ['compute']), nowa-linia. 
Wyjście pisz: (shop ma: ['2computer']), nowa-linia. 
